</span></td>
<td id="A4.T14.4.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.35pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T14.4.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:96.6pt;">
